ction><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请专业</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>050200外国语言文学、055100翻译</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1、全国普通高校本科2023级在校生（2027年应届毕业生）。</span></p><p><span>2、达到所在学校推荐免试生要求且有意申请我校推荐免试硕士研究生。</span></p><p><span>3、对外国语言文学、翻译方向有浓厚兴趣、专业基础扎实、具备较好的学术研究能力和创新能力。</span></p><p><span>4、报考050200外国语言文学专业（英语语种）的学生第二外语应为俄语、日语、法语或德语。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1、申请者须在电子科技大学夏令营报名系统进行网报，</span></strong><span>填写相关信息，网址：https://yzbm.uestc.edu.cn/logon（选择招生项目为“全国优秀大学生夏令营”），系统预计7月1日9:00开放，7月4日16:00关闭，过期不再接受申请。</span></p><p><strong><span>2、电子材料提交：</span></strong></p><p><span>申请者还需要在网上报名系统提交以下材料的电子档：</span></p><p><span>1）身份证及学生证（扫描件，身份证将正反面复印在一张A4纸上，学生证须将个人信息页和注册信息页复印在一张A4纸上）；</span></p><p><span>2）个人简历1份；</span></p><p><span>3）本科阶段前五个学期成绩单及本专业排名的相关证明，须由本科所在学校或院系教务部门盖章；</span></p><p><span>4）体现学习和研究能力的其它相关材料（扫描件。如已发表论文、论文检索证明、各类获奖或资格证书、大学英语六级证书、推荐信等）。</span></p><p><span>注：以上申请材料请通过扫描等方式合并成一份PDF格式的电子文件（不超过10M），文件名为：学校名称-姓名-夏令营报名材料。</span></p><p><strong><span>3、资格审查</span></strong></p><p><span>我院将对申请者的网上报名信息和提交的电子材料进行资格审核，择优确定入选夏令营营员，入选名单将于7月7日公布在学院网站，网址：https://fl.uestc.edu.cn/，未入选者不再另行通知。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>夏令营安排</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>时间：7月10日</span></strong></p><p><span>7月10日：夏令营线上开营仪式、学院及专业介绍</span></p><p><span>注：本日程为拟定计划，如有变化请以最新通知为准。</span></p><p><span>夏令营线上活动拟使用“腾讯会议”平台，申请人须提前下载和安装软件。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>咨询及联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>联系人：张老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：028-61831162</span></p><p><span>联系邮箱：zhangxun@uestc.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>通信地址：四川省成都市高新西区西源大道2006号电子科技大学清水河校区综合楼351办公室。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>06</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>相关信息</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>学生可登录外国语学院教师名录</span><span><span>https://www.fl.uestc.edu.cn/szdw1/jsml.htm，</span></span><span><span>或电子科技大学研招网导师风采https://yjsjy.uestc.edu.cn/gmis/jcsjgl/dsfc</span></span><span><span>等查询外国语学院导师介绍和导师联系方式。</span></span></p><p><span>电子科技大学2026年硕士研究生招生简章（供参考，2027年招生简章以2026年9月公布的最新招生简章为准）：https://yz.uestc.edu.cn/info/1006/5591.htm</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>外国语学院</span></p><p><span>2026年6月24日</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>END</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>编辑排版：言外之意工作室</span></p><p><span>初审：张勋</span></p><p><span>二审：邹涛</span></p><p><span>三审：木帕里色</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/afH33PjFFCicYq2iaSeZOicP47ib3q6NTqsaMEia3lKpeicjicBN2L84F8XhFgdSoaPS4cWCWVplafmMSrsXmjAo1nDmRzu3XnW4XzSpZ3l99qnfbw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"8f69710d8668fb8d1bb36c795d0c7a79d3936273d88aef926b29549747a9c5b0","textLength":1275,"sourceSha256":"0aa71a98c0bfcffeb81e863f490b7436f64bb7c793f36285073d9d4299049cb6","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-50d5400efceb5f8bbf9e","title":"2026年电子科技大学外国语学院2026年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:15.387527+00:00"}
